        "links": [],
        "text": "Λsτre [DST], \nServer Tag: DST\nDST\n — \n3/9/22, 12:14 AM\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:14 AM\nWith the new update that removed the low jumps, were you able to try running on VL2?",
        "times": [
          null
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "951030432001040384",
        "images": [
          {
            "alt": "🤔",
            "src": "https://discord.com/assets/d5d18f9c17a19de2.svg"
          }
        ],
        "links": [],
        "text": "[\n12:15 AM\n]\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:15 AM\nThe jumps are not similar. I tried to play on it and I did some lows tricks, so I was slowed down by the ice in some places  (edited)\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:16 AM",
        "times": [
