          }
        ],
        "links": [],
        "text": "Wins\n — \n3/9/22, 12:41 AM\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:41 AM\nIn Luigi’s Mansion T you had the ledges before the finishline. In last tour after the update I checked and I could low trick from these aswell",
        "times": [
          null
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "951037301788667954",
        "images": [],
        "links": [],
        "text": "[\n12:42 AM\n]\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:42 AM\nSo the high jumps could just be related to the ledges in Ghost Valley tracks.",
        "times": [
          null
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "951037413520732180",
        "images": [],
        "links": [],
        "text": "[\n12:43 AM\n]\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:43 AM\nBecause in that track was the infamous glitch where you could low jump and go under the floor.",
        "times": [
          null
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "951039759457849364",
        "images": [
          {
            "alt": " ",
            "src": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/avatars/278540971048960001/d912e997c2134b88037983e74f95fc6e.webp?size=160"
