        "links": [],
        "text": "Λsτre [DST], \nServer Tag: DST\nDST\n — \n3/9/22, 12:52 AM\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:52 AM\nYes indeed",
        "times": [
          null
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "951039943109672990",
        "images": [],
        "links": [],
        "text": "[\n12:53 AM\n]\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:53 AM\nBut on VL2, there is not ledges on jumps if I'm not wrong",
        "times": [
          null
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "951040111167033345",
        "images": [],
        "links": [],
        "text": "[\n12:53 AM\n]\nWednesday, March 9, 2022 at 12:53 AM\nSo, normally there should be no possibility to do low tricks",
